<details>
<summary><h2>📖 Description</h2></summary>

This project is a **Python-based command-line automation tool** that captures **screenshots at user-defined time intervals** (hourly, minute-wise, or second-wise) and stores them in a specified directory.

It is designed to be:

- ✅ Simple  
- ✅ Cross-platform  
- ✅ Configurable via CLI arguments  
- ✅ Useful for monitoring, logging, and automation tasks  

</details>

